00:27:12.761 --> 00:27:13.752
If you're outside the Apple family

00:27:13.752 --> 00:27:15.844
it's like your persona non grata?

00:27:15.844 --> 00:27:17.369
- Well, yeah, it's kind of like LBJ saying

00:27:17.369 --> 00:27:19.575
you're either in the tent pissing out,

00:27:19.575 --> 00:27:21.811
or you're outside the tent pissing in.

00:27:21.811 --> 00:27:25.453
So I guess I'm outside
the tent pissing in.

00:27:25.453 --> 00:27:26.286
You know,

00:27:28.309 --> 00:27:30.534
at this point in my life,
you may have noticed,

00:27:30.534 --> 00:27:32.657
I really don't give a
(bleep) what people think.

00:27:32.657 --> 00:27:34.769
