00:27:48.648 --> 00:27:49.481
So,

00:27:51.579 --> 00:27:53.335
I just like to tell it like it is.

00:27:53.335 --> 00:27:56.280
I'm 58 years old, you know,
I'm 2/3 dead already so,

00:27:56.280 --> 00:27:57.434
you know.

00:27:57.434 --> 00:27:58.267
- What do you have to lose?

00:27:58.267 --> 00:28:00.266
- Yeah, like, I'm not going to waste time.

00:28:00.266 --> 00:28:04.003
You could also see me on social media.

00:28:04.003 --> 00:28:06.155
When people attack me
and when people do things

00:28:06.155 --> 00:28:07.471
I just block them.

00:28:07.471 --> 00:28:08.621
I just block them.

00:28:08.621 --> 00:28:11.086
I don't try to kiss up, screw them.

00:28:11.086 --> 00:28:12.772
I block a lot of people.

00:28:12.772 --> 00:28:13.909
(audience laughing loudly)

00:28:13.909 --> 00:28:14.984
I block a lot of people.

00:28:14.984 --> 00:28:18.160
I just, you know, I have to
tell, the people that I block

00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:21.827
the most are these just
total troll wussies.

00:28:23.570 --> 00:28:25.569
I would like to use the P word there

00:28:25.569 --> 00:28:27.549
but I'll use the W word.

00:28:27.549 --> 00:28:31.541
And I just, there's like
a small number of people

00:28:31.541 --> 00:28:35.708
on social media who have
such a feeling of entitlement

00:28:36.798 --> 00:28:38.372
and I'll give you an example.

00:28:38.372 --> 00:28:42.539
So Google is giving away
copies of What the Plus!, okay?

00:28:44.030 --> 00:28:46.974
And so you can get it from
