00:30:04.157 --> 00:30:06.179
What goes through their
brain thinking that?

00:30:06.179 --> 00:30:07.841
And so these people with entitlement,

00:30:07.841 --> 00:30:09.561
I can't stand that thought.

00:30:09.561 --> 00:30:12.857
To me, no matter how much you
dislike Google+, or Pinterest,

00:30:12.857 --> 00:30:16.440
or LinkedIn, or whatever,
you're not paying.

00:30:16.440 --> 00:30:19.480
I mean, they're providing
a tremendous service to you

00:30:19.480 --> 00:30:23.417
so the metaphor I like to use
is if somebody invites you

00:30:23.417 --> 00:30:27.584
