you don't show up and say,

00:30:28.854 --> 00:30:32.504
you're not serving what I like, right?

00:30:32.504 --> 00:30:36.479
This is a dinner, you are
a guest in someone's house.

00:30:36.479 --> 00:30:38.919
So shut up and eat or leave.

00:30:38.919 --> 00:30:42.086
(audience applauding)

00:30:43.246 --> 00:30:44.429
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:30:44.429 --> 00:30:47.378
I made this video because
